        <p><span>7.3</span><strong>Use of Customer materials</strong>: The Customer hereby grants the right to ClearTax, its personnel and its third party service providers to use any documentation or materials including systems, methodologies, tools, software, reports, correspondence and advice supplied or made available by or on behalf of the Customer.</p>
